dsh: reasoning:
The fix: match on the result.

```my
def main(args: list[str], out: Stream) -> int:
    match parse_count(args[0]):
        case Ok(value):
            out.print(1 + value)
        case Err(problem):
            out.print(-1)
    return 0
```

